(7419367, 1170592, 8759, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Anthony_D_Archer:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on the Red! Having a debate on where this was taken from - mind sharing? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Night hike on Junk Peak Clearwater Bay. The high-rise buildings complex on the foreground is Lohas Park. The bright spot on the hill is the Tseung Kwan O Chinese Permanent Cemetery. Right top Kowloon,  opposite is the Hong Kong Island.  <br/> <br/>This is a closer view.  <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1073161" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1768/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1073161.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1768/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1073161.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1768/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1073161.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>The wind was too strong. The monsoon tail hit Hong Kong so thats why i bumped the ISO to avoid longer gusts</td>', 'Originally posted by Anthony_D_Archer: Congrats on the Red! Having a debate on where this was taken from - mind sharing?   Night hike on Junk Peak Clearwater Bay. The high-rise buildings complex on the foreground is Lohas Park. The bright spot on the hill is the Tseung Kwan O Chinese Permanent Cemetery. Right top Kowloon,  opposite is the Hong Kong Island.   This is a closer view.     The wind was too strong. The monsoon tail hit Hong Kong so thats why i bumped the ISO to avoid longer gusts', '2015-11-30 04:35:06.000000', NULL, 0),
