(7419416, 1170621, 150277, '<td valign="top">I struggled with this image a bit.  I thought it was kind of clever, a glass that had been left out at night.  But then the glass was so bright and so prominent, it really stood out rather than having been part of a night scene where it was clear the glass had been forgotten.  It also bothered me a bit that the glass seemed kind of dirty - it just wasn''t very enjoyable to look at.</td>', 'I struggled with this image a bit.  I thought it was kind of clever, a glass that had been left out at night.  But then the glass was so bright and so prominent, it really stood out rather than having been part of a night scene where it was clear the glass had been forgotten.  It also bothered me a bit that the glass seemed kind of dirty - it just wasn''t very enjoyable to look at.', '2015-11-30 10:20:19.000000', NULL, 0),
